 a crescendo wedge or end of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"diminuendo wedge are ignored. The niente attribute is yes if a circle appears at the point of the wedge,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indicating a crescendo from nothing or diminuendo to nothing. It is no by default, and used only when the type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is crescendo, or the type is stop for a wedge that began with a diminuendo type. The line-type is solid if not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specified.","type":"text"}]}}}